        "id": "underway",
        "text": "'Good. Pass us through the south gate; the wardens know my seal.'"
      },
      {
        "id": "arrived",
        "text": "Iselt counts her wagons in. 'All here. The Hadda caravan left the wells two days ahead of us, though. They should be here already.'"
      },
      {
        "id": "guard",
        "text": "'Bandits on the ridges east of the city, they say. Keep your hand near your blade.'"
      }
    ]
  },
