            "requires": {
              "kind": "quest",
              "quest": "lost_wagons",
              "status": "ready"
            },
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "complete_quest",
                "quest": "lost_wagons"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Good day."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "waiting",
        "text": "'Our caravan from the wells. It is late, but the day is not over.'"
      },
      {
        "id": "request",
        "text": "'The Hadda caravan should have been here by noon. Their last camp was on the east track. Find out what happened to them.'",
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "I'll find them.",
            "next": "accepted",
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "accept_quest",
                "quest": "lost_wagons"
              },
              {
                "kind": "enter_phase",
                "phase": "lost_wagons"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Not yet."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "accepted",
        "text": "'Take the east track. Mind the ridges; there are bandits about.'"
      },
      {
        "id": "reminder",
        "text": "'Nothing. Their last camp was east of the city.'"
      },
      {
        "id": "thanks",
        "text": "Dravin listens, then sits down heavily. 'A road that is not there. Ask the Dawn Hall. Ask the archive. Ask anyone who knows the old stones.'"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
